    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think anyone's going to be there. it just feels like i'm just occupying space. everyone says things get better, but maybe they don't. maybe some things are just meant to end. i look at the emptiness in the house and i just think... maybe it would be easier if it was just empty all over again. like, if i wasn't here to feel the silence, then the silence wouldn't hurt so much. it's just a lot of weight to carry around for no reason.",
